                   NOVELTY - The system (1) has a detection control server                (90) that transmits a wake-up signal for a                multi-use outer wall concrete block (10)                corresponding to serial number of the concrete                block. A control device unit transmits frequency                band detected by a sound camera. A sensing unit                stores sensing information on the frequency band                and a thermal image in a database. An analyzer                extracts target object information and abnormal                conditions through matching with object information                big data stored in the database. The sensing unit                controls a transceiver to receive through a network                according to a request to start sensing of a                manager mobile phone.
