AB  - In the Russian-Ukrainian war and the Israeli-Palestinian conflict,AI-supported UAV swarm are frequently used for sensing and striking,and this AI-generated ultra-fast kill chain shows great war potential in the current complex urban warfare.At present,the UAV cluster dynamic allocation technology has some problems,such as slow system response,weak resource scheduling and low cooperation efficiency. The dynamic allocation decision model of UAV cluster based on attention mechanism is constructed to improve the solving efficiency,shorten the time consuming in the command and decision stage,and the decision model has strong generalization. Use reinforcement learning (REINFORCE algorithm with baseline)training to simplify the training process.
